1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 7=

3
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:22,000
This is...

4
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:22,630
Piano room.

5
00:01:22,630 --> 00:01:23,480
(SEARCHING)

6
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,590
This is where

7
00:01:24,590 --> 00:01:26,000
I spend most of my time every day.

8
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,890
If I had to name

9
00:01:31,890 --> 00:01:33,120
my only friend at school,

10
00:01:33,780 --> 00:01:34,870
it would probably be this.

11
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,630
The piano?

12
00:01:36,870 --> 00:01:37,480
Yeah.

13
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,400
Ada.

14
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:40,190
I want to check something.

15
00:01:40,510 --> 00:01:41,360
Could you

16
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,400
find that video again

17
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,310
and let me watch it?

18
00:01:43,590 --> 00:01:44,230
Sure.

19
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:48,480
♪The sound of cicadas stretches down
the corridor of summer♪

20
00:01:48,670 --> 00:01:52,730
♪My shadow quietly follows behind you♪

21
00:01:52,730 --> 00:01:56,360
♪Between textbook pages
lie poems I never gave you♪

22
00:01:56,520 --> 00:02:00,730
♪My gaze calculates the best way
to run into you♪

23
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:04,240
♪By the window of that bookstore
you love♪

24
00:02:09,010 --> 00:02:11,560
♪Calculating the best way
to run into you♪

25
00:02:12,830 --> 00:02:14,470
Why is he

26
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:15,830
tapping on the piano panel here?

27
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:17,190
That's so strange.

28
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,860
♪Poems I never gave you♪

29
00:02:22,290 --> 00:02:26,020
♪My gaze calculates the best way
to run into you♪

30
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,160
Morse code.

31
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:43,620
(EDITOR RUN ANALYSTS RESET)

32
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:20,580
(LOCKED)

33
00:03:22,110 --> 00:03:22,840
Li Senyao.

34
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,760
He's really asking me for help.

35
00:03:26,190 --> 00:03:27,380
Do you really believe

36
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:29,720
he's been replaced by an android?

37
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:30,880
Don't you?

38
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,880
My instincts tell me

39
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,390
the person I saw backstage that day

40
00:03:37,390 --> 00:03:38,600
was the real him.

41
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:41,910
Ada.

42
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,880
I don't care if you think I'm crazy.

43
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,020
What scares me more

44
00:03:46,830 --> 00:03:48,470
is that Li Senyao really is
being held captive.

45
00:03:48,830 --> 00:03:50,550
Why else would he go to such lengths

46
00:03:51,110 --> 00:03:52,080
to send this message

47
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,090
to me?

48
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:55,600
He wants me to rescue him!

49
00:03:55,730 --> 00:03:56,310
(Ada.)

50
00:03:58,720 --> 00:03:59,880
(Qiu Lulu isn't crazy.)

51
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:03,040
Although her reasoning makes no sense,

52
00:04:03,630 --> 00:04:04,800
the conclusions she reaches

53
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,880
are all correct.

54
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,880
I found the backstage
surveillance footage

55
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,440
from the stadium the night
she met Li Senyao.

56
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,750
I'll send it to you.

57
00:04:21,270 --> 00:04:22,110
Lulu.

58
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,920
My friend just sent me another video.

59
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:33,180
(Li Senyao SPECIAL CONCERT ONE,
See You There)

60
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,950
Look at your leg.

61
00:04:40,230 --> 00:04:42,000
You're not even halfway
through this tour.

62
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,390
Can you keep going?

63
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,480
I'm fine.

64
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,760
I'm in great shape.

65
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:46,510
Even if you're feeling great,

66
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:48,160
you can't keep going nonstop.

67
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,600
I told you.

68
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,160
It's just an old injury.

69
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,270
I'll be fine.

70
00:04:52,550 --> 00:04:53,390
Senyao.

71
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:56,070
You need to understand

72
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:59,270
that you're not just
representing yourself.

73
00:04:59,270 --> 00:05:00,830
You're representing the company, too.

74
00:05:00,950 --> 00:05:02,070
The company treats all its artists

75
00:05:02,070 --> 00:05:03,670
equally

76
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:05,440
and expects everyone

77
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:06,950
to present themselves at their best.

78
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,430
Don't forget

79
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:15,070
who it was

80
00:05:15,070 --> 00:05:17,350
that spent so much money on your debut.

81
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:20,320
And with the company's
current resources and technology,

82
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:21,550
you've already tried it.

83
00:05:21,550 --> 00:05:22,510
It worked very well.

84
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:25,350
Whether it's performances
or commercial work,

85
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:26,720
he can share your workload.

86
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,480
Do you know

87
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,070
what I regret most right now?

88
00:05:30,110 --> 00:05:31,480
It's letting you
take advantage of my injury

89
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,880
to create that thing.

90
00:05:33,270 --> 00:05:35,070
I must have been out of my mind.

91
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:36,110
Without that thing,

92
00:05:36,110 --> 00:05:37,670
you'd have lost your
commercial value long ago.

93
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:39,720
If you spent six months in the hospital,

94
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,760
all your fans would leave.

95
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,830
- Who would pay the price?
- I told you, I don't agree!

96
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:44,950
Fans pay to see me in concert.

97
00:05:44,950 --> 00:05:46,480
They want to see the real me,

98
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,920
not some so-called empty shell.

99
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,670
Senyao.

100
00:05:57,550 --> 00:05:59,070
(Love)
You're taking a gamble.

101
00:05:59,790 --> 00:06:01,000
You know that.

102
00:06:02,390 --> 00:06:04,070
If something really goes wrong,

103
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:05,270
can you bear the consequences?

104
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,720
In the entire company,

105
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,270
I'm the only one
still looking out for you.

106
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:08,880
Enough.

107
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:09,640
Stop talking.

108
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:11,390
I won't agree to it.

109
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:17,630
I'll keep dancing until
I physically can't anymore.

110
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:25,740
(I love you)

111
00:06:29,230 --> 00:06:30,440
This is the evidence.

112
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:33,390
Senyao has been sidelined
by his company,

113
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,640
or maybe even being held captive.

114
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:37,670
Lulu.

115
00:06:37,950 --> 00:06:39,480
I know you're worried,

116
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,640
but these are just our suspicions.

117
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:44,110
If we act rashly, we could be in danger.

118
00:06:44,270 --> 00:06:44,950
But

119
00:06:45,070 --> 00:06:46,000
if we don't go,

120
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,480
Senyao will be in danger.

121
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,880
He must be somewhere

122
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,670
where he can't trust anyone.

123
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,220
Why else would he send a message

124
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:54,140
to someone like me,

125
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,210
whom he's only met once?

126
00:06:57,110 --> 00:06:58,500
Because he knows I like him.

127
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,160
I love him.

128
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,670
So

129
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,040
he knows that if I find out,

130
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:06,270
I'll definitely go looking for him.

131
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,350
Love?

132
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:08,710
Yes.

133
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:10,100
Love means

134
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:13,200
I don't want anyone to hurt him.

135
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,950
I want to protect him.

136
00:07:16,390 --> 00:07:17,350
Even if

137
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:19,180
he didn't know I existed

138
00:07:19,550 --> 00:07:21,070
before all this,

139
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,390
just seeing him

140
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:24,880
makes me happy.

141
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:43,440
Lulu, I'll go with you.

142
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,300
If there's any danger,

143
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,930
we can look out for each other.

144
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,720
Thank you, Ada.

145
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:51,360
You must be a fan of Senyao's, too.

146
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:53,480
You want to rescue him, don't you?

147
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,920
Is that some kind of delicious food?

148
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:58,790
How can you joke around

149
00:07:58,790 --> 00:08:00,350
at a time like this?

150
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:02,780
Before we leave,

151
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:05,480
can I play this piano?

152
00:08:06,070 --> 00:08:06,880
Of course.

153
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:31,510
Have you studied piano before?

154
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:33,710
This is my first time playing.

155
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,800
Then you're really talented.

156
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,130
It's a shame you're not
studying music with us.

157
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:40,560
But

158
00:08:41,790 --> 00:08:43,130
there's just one little thing missing.

159
00:08:43,340 --> 00:08:44,970
Your performance could use a bit more

160
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:46,920
emotional expression

161
00:08:47,060 --> 00:08:48,280
and feeling for the piece.

162
00:08:49,170 --> 00:08:50,390
Everything else was excellent, though.

163
00:08:52,950 --> 00:08:54,960
How do I express emotion through music?

164
00:08:55,110 --> 00:08:55,890
Well,

165
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:58,820
you have to feel it with your heart.

166
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:03,700
W... We should get going.

167
00:09:03,700 --> 00:09:04,480
While it's still early,

168
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,110
let's head out.

169
00:09:14,660 --> 00:09:16,460
(Relationship between piano and love,
generating search results)

170
00:09:24,140 --> 00:09:24,570
Captain Deng.

171
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:26,440
We found what Song Yang accessed.

172
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,800
It's a very short video.

173
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:31,860
♪The sound of cicadas stretches down
the corridor of summer♪

174
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:32,840
Who's that?

175
00:09:33,230 --> 00:09:35,080
He looks like a pretty popular idol.

176
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,200
Did we open the wrong file?

177
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,320
Quiet.

178
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:41,230
Look into this young man.

179
00:09:41,540 --> 00:09:42,550
Song Yang took

180
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:43,670
such a huge risk today

181
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:45,030
just to get this video.

182
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:47,080
He must have a reason.

183
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:48,620
Get to work.

184
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:49,590
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

185
00:09:50,170 --> 00:09:51,000
Don't be discouraged.

186
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,960
The risk he took today

187
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,960
shows he's getting desperate.

188
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,760
As soon as he makes another move,

189
00:09:57,550 --> 00:09:58,590
it'll only be a matter of time

190
00:09:59,130 --> 00:10:01,000
before we catch him.

191
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,710
The clues point

192
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,350
to this location?

193
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,280
Yes.

194
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:09,590
Li Senyao's talent agency

195
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:10,840
has a long-term agreement

196
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,440
with this business park.

197
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:14,230
It's been reported in the media, too.

198
00:10:14,710 --> 00:10:16,230
Of course,

199
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,780
MG Company also has

200
00:10:17,790 --> 00:10:19,320
its own office building downtown.

201
00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:21,080
So this location

202
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,840
could be used for something else.

203
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,280
Could Senyao really be here?

204
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,000
Let's look around.

205
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:36,760
Be careful.

206
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:37,350
Okay.

207
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:54,580
(Wuxia Recording Studio)

208
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:13,660
(Did you get it?)

209
00:11:15,750 --> 00:11:16,670
Got it.

210
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:18,230
Having you there

211
00:11:18,230 --> 00:11:19,670
to act as a relay for the hack

212
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:20,910
makes things so much easier.

213
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:22,960
(How long do you need?)

214
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,350
How long?

215
00:11:24,590 --> 00:11:25,580
I'm already in.

216
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,660
(Personnel records)

217
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:40,420
(STATUS: ONLINE)

218
00:12:07,710 --> 00:12:14,990
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

219
00:12:15,820 --> 00:12:20,690
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

220
00:12:20,730 --> 00:12:23,600
♪That's me, too♪

221
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:28,660
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

222
00:12:29,490 --> 00:12:32,960
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

223
00:12:33,580 --> 00:12:37,370
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

224
00:12:37,690 --> 00:12:40,220
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

225
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:44,820
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

226
00:12:44,820 --> 00:12:46,950
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

227
00:12:46,950 --> 00:12:50,120
♪Bring me something more?♪

228
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:57,550
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

229
00:12:58,380 --> 00:13:01,780
♪Sadness is blue♪

230
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:06,000
♪How would you paint me?♪

231
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:10,730
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

232
00:13:10,830 --> 00:13:12,990
♪Painting without restraint♪

233
00:13:13,180 --> 00:13:15,770
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

234
00:13:15,770 --> 00:13:19,960
♪If I could start over♪

235
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:24,030
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

236
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:26,780
♪Give me back my smile♪

237
00:13:27,380 --> 00:13:29,860
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

238
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:35,600
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
